Comment:
 s5066-test ships as a self-contained single-file executable that bundles the
 .NET runtime and libraries (Copyright .NET Foundation and Contributors, MIT
 licence). It links only the M0LTE.S5066.Client library, not pdn-soundmodem.
 The Client library is also offered under a commercial licence; this program,
 as packaged here, is distributed under the AGPL.

